Package: com.legacyreborn.tubefixlegacy
Name: TubeFixLegacy
Version: 1.2.0
Architecture: iphoneos-arm
Description: Fixes the Google YouTube app (1.0.0-1.4.0, 2.0.0-2.2.0) and YouTube Classic on iOS 6: feeds, Shorts with a vertical Shorts player, background playback, lock screen controls and double-tap seeking. Based on TubeReplacer by Preloading (GPLv3).
Maintainer: LegacyReborn Project
Author: LegacyReborn Project
Section: Tweaks
Depends: mobilesubstrate (>= 0.9.5000), preferenceloader, firmware (>= 5.0), firmware (<< 11.0)
Conflicts: bag.xml.tuberepair, dev.preloading.tubereplacer
Replaces: dev.preloading.tubereplacer
Icon: file:///Library/PreferenceBundles/TubeFixLegacyPrefs.bundle/icon@full.png
